# An allowlist: only what the image build needs goes into the build context, so nothing from a working
# folder (settings, saved keys, state, backups, caches) can end up in an image by accident.
*
!src/
!requirements.txt
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
